{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいはーい今日から始まりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46ミュージカル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『16人のプリンシパル』( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の朝はいつもとは違って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張続きでした。今まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このためにやってきたレッスン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の成果を皆さんに見せる日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして第二幕からは投票でキャスト"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を選ぶことそういうことから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は落ち着くことがありません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした(´;ω;`)dkdk"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"31人頑張ってきたのは皆一緒です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのにその中から16人を選ぶなんて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛すぎます。でも今までの乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はそういうことがなかったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもいい刺激になると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思うしそれを超えることでまた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個々が成長してるんじゃないかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13位。この数字は始めて自分に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つけてもらった順位です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この13位は入れると思ってなかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしにとっては凄く嬉しい数字。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2回目の13位。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいはずなのに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい涙と悔しい涙がまじりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしってこんな負けず嫌いだっけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と自分を疑うほどでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかしたら欲を言いすぎ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのかもしれませんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしが目指しているのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここではありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8人の住人達に入ることです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この公演中入れないかも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しれないでも、あたしは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しい涙は流さない。と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決めたので悔いの残らないように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演技をしたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日足を運んでくれた方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてあたしに投票してくれた方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切な1票をありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもあたしは頑張り続けます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしの、笑顔が皆さんの心に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"届くように。"},{"type":"break"},{